    Candidate Language=CA-ES-VALENCIA: Ok, enough intro. Let’s dig in.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro4VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CA-ES-VALENCIA: If you need an assistive screen reader, press the Windows, Control, and Enter keys at the same time to turn on Narrator.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro3VoiceOver:
